@ProniaModular.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5245

### Categories - search + sort + paging
GET {{ProniaModular.API_HostAddress}}/api/categories?search=men&sortBy=productcount&desc=true&page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### Categories - create
POST {{ProniaModular.API_HostAddress}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Men"
}

### Sizes - create
POST {{ProniaModular.API_HostAddress}}/api/sizes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "XL"
}

### Products - create
POST {{ProniaModular.API_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Blue shirt",
  "price": 49.99,
  "description": "Cotton shirt",
  "categoryId": 1
}

### Products - all combinations at once (search + filter + sort + paging)
GET {{ProniaModular.API_HostAddress}}/api/products?search=shirt&categoryId=1&minPrice=10&maxPrice=99&sizeId=1&sortBy=price&desc=true&page=1&pageSize=5
Accept: application/json

### Products - soft delete
DELETE {{ProniaModular.API_HostAddress}}/api/products/1

### Products - deleted rows are hidden by the global query filter
GET {{ProniaModular.API_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

### Products - IgnoreQueryFilters(): deleted rows become visible again
GET {{ProniaModular.API_HostAddress}}/api/products?includeDeleted=true
Accept: application/json

### Products - restore
POST {{ProniaModular.API_HostAddress}}/api/products/1/restore

### Products - permanent delete
DELETE {{ProniaModular.API_HostAddress}}/api/products/1/hard

### ProductSizes - assign a size to a product
POST {{ProniaModular.API_HostAddress}}/api/products/1/sizes/1

### ProductSizes - list
GET {{ProniaModular.API_HostAddress}}/api/products/1/sizes
Accept: application/json
